{
  "parsedXmlData": "<rss version=\"0.92\"><channel><title>JIRA</title><link>https://lspapp.atlassian.net</link><description>This file is an XML representation of an issue</description><language>en-us</language><build-info><version>1001.0.0-SNAPSHOT</version><build-number>100287</build-number><build-date>23-07-2025</build-date></build-info><item><title>[DEV-15378] [Notifications] Custom and Default admins do not receive 'Time Revised By Interpreter' notifications</title><link>https://lspapp.atlassian.net/browse/DEV-15378</link><project id=\"10000\" key=\"DEV\">Development</project><description>&lt;p&gt;Reported via &lt;a href=\"https://lspapp.atlassian.net/browse/PP-8433\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\"&gt;https://lspapp.atlassian.net/browse/PP-8433&lt;/a&gt; .&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Custom and Default admins (interpreter and requestor) do not receive ‘Time Revised By Interpreter’ communication notifications. Other user roles receive the notification as expected.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Tested on staging and US prod.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Repro:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create a custom admin with default role access&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Update communication notification ‘Time Revised By Interpreter’ so only the custom admin will receive the email&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create an onsite appointment, assign requestor and interpreter&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;As interpreter revise the start end/time for the appointment&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Check email/logs for notification email sent to custom admin&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;Expected result: notification email is sent to custom admin&lt;/p&gt;</description><key id=\"60220\">DEV-15378</key><summary>[Notifications] Custom and Default admins do not receive 'Time Revised By Interpreter' notifications</summary><type id=\"10199\" iconUrl=\"https://lspapp.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">Defect</type><priority id=\"2\" iconUrl=\"https://lspapp.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/high_new.svg\">High</priority><status id=\"10308\" iconUrl=\"https://lspapp.atlassian.net/images/icons/statuses/generic.png\" description=\"\">Ready For Testing</status><statusCategory id=\"4\" key=\"indeterminate\" colorName=\"yellow\"/><resolution id=\"-1\">Unresolved</resolution><assignee accountid=\"557058:bf72cd80-5754-4e78-9de4-bed28880e058\">Pavel Savrovsky</assignee><reporter accountid=\"712020:79c4f308-8b73-492a-8707-3c2bca52afe7\">Jake Orona</reporter><labels><label>jira_escalated</label><label>jira_update</label></labels><created>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 16:19:01 -0500</created><updated>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 14:22:57 -0500</updated><version>LSP.APP_7.5.3</version>
